{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因为重新感受到熟悉的亲近而很开心，几乎想把藏着的话说出来，却还是没有开口。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、迫切、紧张、舍不得、犹豫\",\n      \"missed\": \"他不敢说出口的具体顾虑：怕说得太多让对方为难，也怕破坏两个人原有的自在；左手水波不断向前、仿佛每秒都在倒数的画面，需要读粉色小字才能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很想趁着两个人亲近的时候说出心里话，也想把眼下的美好留住，但最终还是有所保留。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、心动、迫切、不舍、患得患失\",\n      \"missed\": \"他为什么最终选择不说，以及说出口可能带来的关系变化，需要读完最下面的长句才能明白。粉色的水波、倒数意象也不是一眼就能和人物处境对应起来。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经很想把心里的话告诉对方，却担心打破眼下的亲近和自在，所以最后还是没有完全说出来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、心动、紧张、迫切、不舍、犹豫\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的长颤音像金光、音乐逐渐收弱、话到喉咙口发紧等细节，需要逐句读才能理解；他害怕对方为难、害怕失去原有相处状态的顾虑也不容易一眼抓全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"人物主线其实比较清楚，但三段大字号长句都在讲相近的心理活动，视觉上同时争夺注意力；真正解释他为什么想说又忍住的关键顾虑藏在最后一段。粉色小字又穿插了声线、花腔、金光、水波、倒数等音乐画面，虽然整体能和不舍、迫切的情绪对应，但一眼扫过时，容易先抓到人物想说又没说的故事，却没能同时抓住画面与人物处境之间的关系。第三张新增的音乐描写进一步增加了扫读负担，但没有破坏主线。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b68c14b2-90af-45c4-ad69-5e241222d4a2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T000132730845Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:02:44.056302+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b34126fa985c9b18d4622d9b2bf3d7deb3af79c3951fcb03c484bd6255fd64ff", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T000132730845Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f6a206f24eabb388fe5b5989a2b8b68639fcdd3a81b224e4d176106a5d7ed21c"}}}
